],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl space-y-space-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary-fixed tracking-widest uppercase font-bold","children":"Scale & Operations"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"font-headline-xl lg:text-[44px] lg:leading-[52px] text-surface-container-lowest font-extrabold tracking-tight","children":"The Real Unit Economics of Offshore RPO: A Guide for Agency Managing Directors"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container-high leading-relaxed","children":"Examining true cost comparisons, billable hours expansion, and ROI timelines when transitioning to specialised offshore pods."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pt-space-xs","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary-fixed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]","children":"person"}],"By ","Elena Vasquez",", ","Head of Delivery"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]","children":"calendar_today"}],"02 Sep 2025"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]","children":"schedule"}],"7 min read"]}]]}]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop max-w-4xl space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative aspect-[16/9] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg","children":["$","$L3",null,{"alt":"Close up of financial and operational management report spreadsheets showing overhead reductions and growth margins under warm modern desk lighting.","className":"object-cover","src":"/images/blog-2.jpg","fill":true,"sizes":"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw","priority":true}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div","The Margin Story Behind Every Offshore Desk",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"The Margin Story Behind Every Offshore Desk"}],[["$","p","Managing directors rarely reject offshore RPO on principle. They reject it because the numbers presented are too vague to underwrite. Percentage savings claims and testimonials do not survive contact with a board spreadsheet. Unit economics do.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Managing directors rarely reject offshore RPO on principle. They reject it because the numbers presented are too vague to underwrite. Percentage savings claims and testimonials do not survive contact with a board spreadsheet. Unit economics do."}],["$","p","This guide sets out how to model an offshore desk honestly: what it costs, what it produces, and when it pays for itself. The framework below is the same one we use when scoping engagements with UK and US agencies.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"This guide sets out how to model an offshore desk honestly: what it costs, what it produces, and when it pays for itself. The framework below is the same one we use when scoping engagements with UK and US agencies."}]],null]}],["$","div","The Real Cost of an Onshore Consultant",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"The Real Cost of an Onshore Consultant"}],[["$","p","A mid-level onshore consultant in London or New York carries far more cost than the headline salary. Employers absorb pension contributions, national insurance or payroll taxes, benefits, equipment, desk space, recruitment fees, and the risk of early attrition.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A mid-level onshore consultant in London or New York carries far more cost than the headline salary. Employers absorb pension contributions, national insurance or payroll taxes, benefits, equipment, desk space, recruitment fees, and the risk of early attrition."}],["$","p","Once those layers are totalled, the fully loaded cost of a single onshore hire can reach 1.4 to 1.6 times base salary. That figure is the true comparison point for any offshore proposal, and it is the number most internal business cases quietly leave out.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Once those layers are totalled, the fully loaded cost of a single onshore hire can reach 1.4 to 1.6 times base salary. That figure is the true comparison point for any offshore proposal, and it is the number most internal business cases quietly leave out."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs bg-slate-surface rounded-xl p-space-lg","children":[["$","li","Base salary plus employer taxes and pension",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Base salary plus employer taxes and pension"}]]}],["$","li","Benefits, equipment, and desk overhead",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Benefits, equipment, and desk overhead"}]]}],["$","li","Agency fees amortised across expected tenure",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Agency fees amortised across expected tenure"}]]}],["$","li","Attrition risk and the cost of rehiring",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Attrition risk and the cost of rehiring"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","What a Fixed Monthly Retainer Covers",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"What a Fixed Monthly Retainer Covers"}],[["$","p","Our engagements are priced as a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated resource. The retainer includes salary, workstation infrastructure, security tooling, benefits, software licences, and dedicated delivery management. There are no placement fees, no setup penalties, and no charges that appear after signature.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Our engagements are priced as a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated resource. The retainer includes salary, workstation infrastructure, security tooling, benefits, software licences, and dedicated delivery management. There are no placement fees, no setup penalties, and no charges that appear after signature."}],["$","p","Fixed pricing changes the conversation. You can forecast cost per desk on a twelve-month horizon without modelling volatile commission structures. Your finance team gets a predictable line item, and the delivery team gets a defined scope.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Fixed pricing changes the conversation. You can forecast cost per desk on a twelve-month horizon without modelling volatile commission structures. Your finance team gets a predictable line item, and the delivery team gets a defined scope."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs bg-slate-surface rounded-xl p-space-lg","children":[["$","li","One resource, one predictable monthly cost",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"One resource, one predictable monthly cost"}]]}],["$","li","Infrastructure and licences included",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Infrastructure and licences included"}]]}],["$","li","No placement or conversion fees",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"No placement or conversion fees"}]]}],["$","li","Month-to-month terms without long lock-ins",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Month-to-month terms without long lock-ins"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","Modelling Billable Hours Expansion",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Modelling Billable Hours Expansion"}],[["$","p","The economics only work if capacity converts into revenue. A sourcing pod that delivers fifteen qualified shortlists a month creates billable potential that did not exist before; the question is whether the agency has requisitions to absorb it.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The economics only work if capacity converts into revenue. A sourcing pod that delivers fifteen qualified shortlists a month creates billable potential that did not exist before; the question is whether the agency has requisitions to absorb it."}],["$","p","Serious business cases therefore start with pipeline, not headcount. If your consultants currently turn away briefs, the expansion case is straightforward. If they do not, the offshore desk should begin with back-office or data work where the return is easier to isolate.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Serious business cases therefore start with pipeline, not headcount. If your consultants currently turn away briefs, the expansion case is straightforward. If they do not, the offshore desk should begin with back-office or data work where the return is easier to isolate."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs bg-slate-surface rounded-xl p-space-lg","children":[["$","li","Requisitions refused last quarter as your baseline",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Requisitions refused last quarter as your baseline"}]]}],["$","li","Placements per consultant before and after deployment",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Placements per consultant before and after deployment"}]]}],["$","li","Average fee value by desk and sector",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Average fee value by desk and sector"}]]}],["$","li","Break-even placements per month",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Break-even placements per month"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","ROI Timelines and Payback Periods",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"ROI Timelines and Payback Periods"}],[["$","p","In our experience, an offshore research or sourcing desk reaches payback within one to two billing cycles when the pipeline exists. Administrative desks pay back more slowly but with less variance, typically over one to two quarters.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"In our experience, an offshore research or sourcing desk reaches payback within one to two billing cycles when the pipeline exists. Administrative desks pay back more slowly but with less variance, typically over one to two quarters."}],["$","p","Payback is not the same as profit. The stronger question is contribution per desk after twelve months, including ramp time, training, and any restructuring of onshore roles. Most agencies that model properly find offshore leverage improves gross margin by four to nine points.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Payback is not the same as profit. The stronger question is contribution per desk after twelve months, including ramp time, training, and any restructuring of onshore roles. Most agencies that model properly find offshore leverage improves gross margin by four to nine points."}]],null]}],["$","div","Where Offshore Budgets Quietly Leak",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"Where Offshore Budgets Quietly Leak"}],[["$","p","Weak offshore engagements fail in predictable places. Scope creep turns a sourcing pod into an administrative catch-all, unclear KPIs make performance impossible to judge, and poor integration leaves offshore staff waiting on system access rather than working briefs.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Weak offshore engagements fail in predictable places. Scope creep turns a sourcing pod into an administrative catch-all, unclear KPIs make performance impossible to judge, and poor integration leaves offshore staff waiting on system access rather than working briefs."}],["$","p","Governance prevents these leaks. Fortnightly SLA scorecards, named delivery managers, and written scope definitions keep the engagement tight. When a desk drifts, the scorecard shows it within weeks rather than quarters.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Governance prevents these leaks. Fortnightly SLA scorecards, named delivery managers, and written scope definitions keep the engagement tight. When a desk drifts, the scorecard shows it within weeks rather than quarters."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs bg-slate-surface rounded-xl p-space-lg","children":[["$","li","Written scope with named deliverables",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Written scope with named deliverables"}]]}],["$","li","Fortnightly SLA scorecard reviews",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Fortnightly SLA scorecard reviews"}]]}],["$","li","Defined escalation and change process",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Defined escalation and change process"}]]}],["$","li","Quarterly commercial review with leadership",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Quarterly commercial review with leadership"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","What to Build Into the Business Case",{"className":"space-y-space-md","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"What to Build Into the Business Case"}],[["$","p","A defensible proposal contains three numbers: fully loaded onshore cost, fixed offshore retainer, and expected capacity output. Add one quarter of ramp time and a conservative conversion assumption, and the model will survive scrutiny from your board.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A defensible proposal contains three numbers: fully loaded onshore cost, fixed offshore retainer, and expected capacity output. Add one quarter of ramp time and a conservative conversion assumption, and the model will survive scrutiny from your board."}],["$","p","We will build that model with you before any commitment. Bring your current desk costs, fee averages, and unfilled requisitions; we will bring benchmarks from comparable UK and US engagements.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"We will build that model with you before any commitment. Bring your current desk costs, fee averages, and unfilled requisitions; we will bring benchmarks from comparable UK and US engagements."}]],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs bg-slate-surface rounded-xl p-space-lg","children":[["$","li","Fully loaded onshore cost per desk",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Fully loaded onshore cost per desk"}]]}],["$","li","Offshore retainer and ramp assumptions",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-main","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-emerald-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0","children":"check_circle"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Offshore retainer and ramp assumptions"}]]}],["$","li","Conservative output and conversion rates",{"className":"flex items-start gap-space-sm font-bod